                "lens": "readability",
                "location": "engine/cmd/review.go:310-313",
                "severity": "SUGGESTION",
                "claim": "reportVerified calls slices.DeleteFunc on the result of review.ParentFields(). DeleteFunc mutates the slice in place; if ParentFields returns a shared package-level slice rather than a fresh copy, this would corrupt it for later calls. The code does not make the ownership assumption explicit, so a maintainer cannot tell it is safe without reading another package.",
                "proof_refs": [
                  "engine/cmd/review.go:310-313"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "R2-require-map",
                "lens": "readability",
                "location": "engine/cmd/review.go:137",
                "severity": "SUGGESTION",
                "claim": "require builds a name-to-value map that now mixes flags of different verbs (--stored added). A name not in the map (for example a typo in a caller) silently reads as empty and reports 'is required'. This is tolerable but the shared map hides which verb needs which flag.",
                "proof_refs": [
                  "engine/cmd/review.go:137"
                ]
              }
            ],
