            "evidence": [
              "Reviewed all five changed paths. The new verify verb is covered by tests of its flag errors (missing, duplicate and foreign flags), its refusal path (exit 2, nothing stored), its spent correction round (exit 1, nothing stored), reading the reply from a file or stdin, and the decision and skeleton output in engine/cmd/review_test.go. The built-program test also checks that roles validate accepts the skeleton.",
              "The usage-text assertions in engine/cmd/review_test.go match the strings added in engine/cmd/usage.go. The verb-list and unknown-verb messages changed consistently in engine/cmd/review.go, engine/cmd/review_test.go and engine/cmd/dispatch_routes_test.go.",
              "Residual risk, not reported as a finding: reportVerified in engine/cmd/review.go filters the result of review.ParentFields() with slices.DeleteFunc, which mutates the slice in place. That is only safe if ParentFields returns a fresh slice, and its definition is outside this candidate. The table test in engine/cmd/review_test.go runs a case with to_role removed before a case that expects it, so it would catch a shared slice."
            ]
